:: Dom - Alt route confrontation [bg-underground]
<h1 class="ptitle">UNDERGROUND CITY</h1>
<br />

A folded note found its way into your pocket sometime during the day — you never saw who left it. Isabel's handwriting, three words.

<br /><br />

<center>
	<<image 'places/underground/note_folded.jpg' sfw>>
</center>
<br />

<strong><em>His guards are gone.</em></strong>

<br /><br />

You'd never set foot in Dom's office. Never needed to, never been invited. But Isabel had given you the route days ago, murmured between other things in a locked bathroom — which corridor, which door, which hour the men watching it would conveniently be elsewhere.

<br /><br />

You checked what you were carrying. Whatever happened next, there wouldn't be a second chance to go back for a weapon.

<br /><br />

<<if $backpack.has('revolver') || $backpack.has('knife')>>
	<<link 'Go to his office'>>
		<<goto 'Dom - kill'>>
	<</link>>
<<else>>
	<p style="color: #cc5555;">You don't have a weapon on you. Come back once you're carrying a knife or a revolver.</p>
	<br />
	<<link 'Turn back'>>
		<<goto 'Underground city'>>
	<</link>>
<</if>>
